+	/*
+	 * A _TMP that reads back EXACTLY _CRT, when the previous reading was not
+	 * already approaching _CRT, is a firmware "sensor unreadable" sentinel,
+	 * not a real temperature. On ThinkPads \_TZ.THM0._TMP returns TCRT (== _CRT)
